  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"0.4.8\"\n\npackage:\n  name: just-lsp\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/terror/just-lsp/archive/refs/tags/${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: dd62ebb8da4e1c3e55c915a3ad28b04f8962528c7f0dcc31a1ae0873620ce207\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    env:\n      CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_LTO: fat\n      CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_STRIP: symbols\n    content:\n      - if: unix\n        then:\n          - cargo auditable install --no-track --locked --bins --root=\"$PREFIX\" --path=.\n      - if: win\n        then:\n          # replace broken symlink on Windows with target directory content\n          # TODO: remove workaround once https://github.com/terror/just-lsp/pull/411 is merged and released\n          - 'powershell -Command \"Remove-Item vendor/tree-sitter-just-src; Copy-Item -Recurse vendor/tree-sitter-just/src vendor/tree-sitter-just-src\"'\n          - cargo auditable install --no-track --locked --bins --root=\"%LIBRARY_PREFIX%\" --path=.\n      - cargo-bundle-licenses --format=yaml --output=./THIRDPARTY.yml\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('rust') }}\n    - cargo-auditable\n    - cargo-bundle-licenses\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - if: build_platform == host_platform\n        then:\n          - just-lsp --help\n          - just-lsp --version\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - just-lsp\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: A language server for just\n  description: |\n    just-lsp is a server implementation of the language server protocol for\n    just, the command runner. It brings rich editor support to justfiles,\n    including completions, hover docs, jump to definition, diagnostics,\n    rename/find references, code actions, semantic highlighting, folding,\n    and formatting.\n  license: CC0-1.0\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - THIRDPARTY.yml\n  homepage: https://terror.github.io/just-lsp/\n  repository: https://github.com/terror/just-lsp\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - salim-b\n",
